WEBVTT

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.630
I thought we were done for.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.140
It looks like Haruto's Sense has returned.

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:25.520
All that's left is to gather
the members of Subaru together!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.310
Yeah, but...

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.190
we don't know how to contact
Clive and Nozomi.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.700
Takanori is the only one we know how to contact.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.870
I hope they'll come back.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.160
It'll be okay! It'll work out!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.040
Why are you always so optimistic?

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.080
-Come on.
-Do you really think so?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.750
I'm sure they'll all come back.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.800
You're pretty confident.

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:53.760
What's this?

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.090
It fell from your collar.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:00.600
Maybe it's an item drop for beating the boss?

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.930
When did you get that?

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.440
-Asahi!
-Asahi, are you okay?

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.460
What was that just now?
Was it Asahi's Prophet Art?

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:35.170
You guys...

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.720
saw it too.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:43.680
That might have been my six years.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.920
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:22.910
Dissonance

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:29.540
That was your six years?
What do you mean?

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.290
I don't know.
That's just what I felt.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:37.840
If you don't know,
then how are we supposed to know?

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.260
Don't think too hard now.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.430
Think about it later
when you remember something.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.430
Yeah. Thanks, Haruto.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.690
-You're being really nice to Asahi.
-What? I'm acting normal.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.780
Hey. They're back.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.870
Did they really defeat it?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.210
They're so rude.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.460
Why are they all looking at us?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.050
Let's go to your room, Asahi.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.140
I'm beat.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.400
-Welcome back.
-What's that?

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.700
I asked the flower elemental to gather rumors for me.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.530
Is it true that they beat Purgatorio?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.160
It sounds fake.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:52.620
Rumors are spreading that we beat Purgatorio.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.580
So, that's the reason for that weird aura just now.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.290
Probably. But...

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.420
The rumors are spreading too fast.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.800
It's been less than two hours since we beat him.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:07.550
That being said...

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.970
It happened with Leonovitch as well.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.680
Maybe someone's spreading the word.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.190
Who? And why?

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.730
For now we should focus on what we have to do.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.690
We have to find a way for Asahi to log out.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:29.240
Right. That vision we saw just now,
it might be a hint.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:32.160
Maybe Asahi saw that somewhere.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.420
It's no use. I don't understand at all.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.540
Especially that modern facility we saw at the end.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.380
It's not linked with the world of Re'Union.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.130
We don't even have a clue.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.180
-It's because there are still only three of us!
-Three?

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:53.720
When we were all together,
we always overcame these kinds of challenges.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.850
First, we have to revive Subaru.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.940
We can't do anything until we have everyone.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:06.030
The problem is finding out whether
Clive and Nozomi play Re'Union.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.120
Do you want to start off with a visit?

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.450
I know a good informant.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:21.710
You're right. Asking an informant is the best way
to find someone.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:26.170
The informant uses elementals as familiars
and shares their sense of sight.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.010
With ten at once.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.260
Magic is so useful.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.310
What's wrong?

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:40.440
It's them! Southern Cross is here!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:44.190
Southern Cross?
Why did they come to a remote place like this?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.570
Who knows!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.530
Southern Cross? That name brings back memories.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.370
Most of the high guilds have survived.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:57.120
Takanori's Illuminati is now one of them.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:01.670
-Let's avoid any unnecessary trouble.
-Yeah.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.960
We'll visit the informant later.
Let's get away from here.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.230
Are they after us?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.650
Nice to meet you. If I may...

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.610
I'm the leader of Southern Cross, Letos.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.110
Hand over Asahi Kuga.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.870
Coeur de Lion and Innocensia,
we welcome you...

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.910
-The legendary Subaru...
-Satsuki...

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.090
We're surrounded.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.460
But the sky is open.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:54.760
We've got a thousand guild members.
There's no escape.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.270
A ragtag group of a thousand is nothing for us.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.650
Don't act smart.
Subaru is just a rusty legend.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.900
You're nothing--

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.690
What's going on?

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.990
The Brill Society?

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.290
Hey, Letos.
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:22.870
Angelus.
Trying to steal my prey from under my nose.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.420
That's not like you.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.500
I just want to talk to them.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:33.430
Retreat, Letos.
When we're done, we'll leave.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.180
What did you say?

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:40.020
Or do you mean to turn this place into a battlefield
and get bogged down?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:44.140
Though, I'm sure there are others who would like that.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:47.980
I'll withdraw.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.200
I'm glad I didn't have to use my Sense.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.740
I'm glad you're safe.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:02.200
I'm the leader of the Brill Society, Angelus.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.620
You're not the same leader from Union.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.290
True. I'm the second leader.

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:11.260
I don't despise you all like the first leader did.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.090
Relax.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.340
What are you trying to do?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.980
I have a proposal.
Come under my protection.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.190
I knew that's what you wanted.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:31.190
Re'Union is a utopia for me and all the players.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:34.610
That's why it needs appropriate management.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.240
How's that related to becoming your ally?

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.910
We're not after your powers.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:48.880
It's because your existence,
and Asahi in particular, distorts this world.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.130
Me?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.010
Regardless of whether the Prophet Art is real,

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.590
people who want more power will fight over it.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.470
It's already begun.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.760
You're one of them too.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.850
I just can't stand having this world disturbed.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.940
If Asahi stays with us,

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.570
no one can touch her.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:16.030
It's not a bad offer for you either.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.490
No way.

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:20.700
We're Subaru.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:24.750
I don't want to be confined by a guild.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.200
You fool...

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.920
We decide how we're going to live here ourselves!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.050
We're not letting anyone tell us what to do!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:38.680
I see. I won't force you.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.760
Force is also distortion.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:47.310
Your existence is like a joker card in this world.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:51.060
If something happens
to disturb the balance in this world,

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.070
I'll to do everything in my power to defeat you.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:11.040
Southern Cross and the Brill Society are on the move.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.590
We're monitoring them.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.340
Please continue.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.100
Outlaws and hypocrites.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.440
Are you after my Asahi?

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.520
Know your place.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.610
QUEEN OF ELEMENTALS
INNOCENSIA

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.860
SATSUKI USUI

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.370
He's late.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.910
HARUTO:
CAN WE MEET UP?

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.370
HARUTO:
CAN WE MEET AT AROUND 11?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.630
Sorry I'm late.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.340
It's okay. I just got here too.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:58.630
Oh, really?

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.760
Let's go.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:03.260
Okay.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.560
Thanks for coming.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:20.360
If we're going to seriously get into Re'Union,
I want to get a new machine.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:25.660
I don't know much about the latest hardware.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.200
Right.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.410
What?

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.250
Nothing.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.420
Anyway, we're done here. See you.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.170
Satsuki, how about lunch together?

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.720
Yeah, it's delicious.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.680
It's good, right?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:54.060
I know I said I'd treat you to lunch
since you came with me today, but...

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:56.690
You're the one who said we could go anywhere.

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.400
Yeah, but...

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.780
I couldn't get a hold of Clive.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.820
You couldn't reach him?

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:09.080
I sent e-mails and messages to the addresses
I remember,

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.740
but they all came back with errors.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:11.910
MAIL ERROR
INVALID EMAIL ADDRESS

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.080
How about you?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:17.380
I didn't get any errors, so the address is still valid.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.790
But the messages haven't been marked as read.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.720
I guess Nozomi won't come either.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.010
Clive lives overseas,

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.640
and Nozomi goes to a different school.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:32.140
Six years have gone by.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.770
Here's the cake set and the carbonara.
Thanks for waiting.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:36.940
Yeah!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.110
You can't call that lunch.

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:45.900
I used to dream about eating
as much cake as I wanted when I was a kid,

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.030
but when I actually tried it,
it wasn't a big deal.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.790
That's too bad.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:56.870
Asahi also said she wanted to eat
a mountain of whipped cream.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.750
I wonder if Asahi's okay.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.380
What do you mean?

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:06.630
We're leaving her alone at night, right?

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:08.840
I wonder if she's lonely.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:14.140
I feel bad that we're the only ones doing this.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.060
When I contact the operating company
they just say she's not registered.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.360
Hey...

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:24.360
isn't this beyond our control?

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:29.160
If we told the police there's a dead person
who's still alive in the game,

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.280
they wouldn't listen to us.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.830
We need more information
to get them to do something.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:40.040
We should at least try talking to Asahi's family.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.040
"Asahi's alive in the game."

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.050
How can we tell them that?

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:49.550
I think you just want to keep Asahi to yourself.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.010
What? What are you talking about?

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:55.850
I just don't want to regret acting careless!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:59.060
We don't know what'll happen
if she gets a game over again.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.810
I know that!

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.560
What? What happened?

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:07.740
Sorry.

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:11.360
-Sorry for disturbing you.
-I'm going home.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.130
You're late, Haruto.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.380
I'm not that late.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.590
Where are we going today?

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.590
That vision we saw yesterday,

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.140
I'm curious about it.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:36.060
Asahi, you said it was your memory
of those six years, right?

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:38.980
I just felt that way.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.140
I wonder why I thought so.

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:44.650
I thought we could try searching for that place.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.030
Satsuki, do you have any ideas?

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.950
I can't tell where it is from only that information.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.450
Right.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:57.700
We don't even know if that place is somewhere
Asahi saw in reality.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.370
It's no use. I don't understand at all.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.380
You must remember.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.460
Asahi, do you remember?

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.050
The first place the Prophet Art was activated.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.220
Yeah, I remember that,
the Tower of Heaven!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:16.640
That was a really weird place.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:19.770
The view from the top was like "Woah!".

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.390
What do you mean by "Woah!"?

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:24.980
Satsuki.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.770
Is something wrong?

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.980
Nothing. The Tower of Heaven. Right.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.400
Let's try going there.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.040
It's the same as it was back then.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:51.760
Next!

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:57.930
That was easy.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.350
We were much more desperate in the beginning.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.730
You were the most desperate!

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:05.020
Oh, really?

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:09.110
Satsuki had already awakened her Sense
when we came here, right?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.320
Yeah, but...

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:17.280
back then, even though my Sense was strong,
I couldn't control it.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:23.910
Everyone saved me.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.540
Satsuki, wait!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.880
The last stage is ahead, right?

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.720
It should be.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.140
Satsuki, are you ready?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.180
Are you feeling okay?

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.560
You're acting strange today.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.650
Don't worry about me.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.980
Let's go.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.480
Hey.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:03.080
-Do you remember what to do?
-Yeah.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.750
Intruders confirmed.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.960
Entering annihilation mode.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.480
Let's go!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.360
Melt them, Vatical!

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:38.110
Eternal Bullets of Flame!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.210
That wasn't very hard.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.540
We were still at a low level back then.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.050
The second round is coming.

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:01.640
We had a hard time with the fog last time.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:06.020
Satsuki can blow this away
with her light element now.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.480
I'm counting on you.

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.600
No--

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.610
-Satsuki?
-I'll do it instead!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.200
Satsuki!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.380
Are you okay, Satsuki?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:34.210
-I got it!
-I'm counting on you!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.130
Take this!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.440
We barely made it the first time
after I used the Prophet Art.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.610
This time it was easy with just us three.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:00.360
What happened?
It's unlike you to get caught by a Roper.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:04.490
Then the two of you
should've tackled this dungeon alone!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.620
What are you saying?

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.620
I was just a little careless.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.000
I'm sorry.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.760
Do you remember anything?

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:25.930
No. Nothing!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.010
Can't you be more serious?

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.940
Hey. Is it okay to leave Satsuki alone?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.780
Now that you mention it...

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.490
Let's go back for now.

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:48.410
-Yeah.
-I'll get out the teleportation device.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:52.540
What? If you ran out, let's use mine.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.670
No. What's this?

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:00.840
I don't remember ever putting this in my item box.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:03.220
Is that the one you picked up
the other day?

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.510
I left that stone at the inn.

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:07.800
The shape is different.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:10.140
What's this?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.430
It's so nostalgic.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.560
Asahi, wait!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:21.650
Takanori.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.150
Takanori, what are you doing? Give it back!

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:26.860
This is dangerous. Don't look at it.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:29.080
How do you know?

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:33.040
My Divinity Sense is telling me
it's something bad.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:38.130
And you passed out
when you saw the same thing before.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.590
How do you...?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:44.300
The high guilds get that kind of information.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:47.220
Are you trying to kill Asahi, Haruto?

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:51.260
You don't deserve to be the one protecting Asahi.

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:54.730
Are you saying that you do?

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:59.110
I've made preparations in Re'Union to do that.

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:00.730
Unlike you.

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.740
Do you want to test that out?

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.030
Stop, you two!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.240
Solitude!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:15.460
Now we don't have to worry about Asahi and Satsuki
getting involved.

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.790
Takanori...

00:23:55.470 --> 00:23:56.970
Oh, it's a hot spring.

00:23:57.140 --> 00:23:58.600
We're not here to play!

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:00.690
But you went on a date with Satsuki.

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:02.900
She just came shopping with me.

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:05.360
And you had lunch together too!

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:07.650
Episode 5, "Swirling Conspiracy."

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:09.740
That's not fair!
